================================================================================
866 AG — RELIGION SPECIFICATION
================================================================================
Canonical spec for every religion, faith and religion family in Echoes of the
Grip. Reconciled against docs/SETTING LORE (+ its ERRATA block), the shipped
script in common/religion/, and real CK3 1.19 syntax.

Last rewritten: 2026-08-29
Supersedes: the "27 religions" implementation guide previously in this file.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHY THIS FILE WAS REWRITTEN
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The previous draft could not be implemented as written. It specified religions
using field names that do not exist in CK3 (`mercenary_troops`, `type =
"organized"`, `category`, `religious_head_title`, `preach_to_other_flocks`),
doctrine names that do not exist in any CK3 version (`marriage_doctrine_no_-
clergy_marriage`, `pluralism_doctrine_singular_god`, `religious_authority_-
doctrine_hidden`), and modifiers that are not CK3 modifiers (`trade_value_-
multiplier`, `corruption_gain`, `holy_war_cb`, `excommunication_ineffective`).

It also used unprefixed identifiers (`elrossi_faith`, `frozt_worship`), which
violates the one rule in CLAUDE.md that cannot be broken, and it conflicted
with names already shipped in script.

This file now records what is actually implemented, what the real schema is,
and what remains on the backlog.

